[{"id":167497743,"discussion_id":"c0fdfe6d8155a495332efabe78c51f6ababacb98","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| math/reduce_all | ✅ [*zhangyuxiang0119*](https://gitcode.com/zhangyuxiang0119), [*FelixTang7*](https://gitcode.com/FelixTang7) (2/2) | ✅ [*zhangyuxiang0119*](https://gitcode.com/zhangyuxiang0119) (1/1) |\n| math/reduce_any | ✅ [*zhangyuxiang0119*](https://gitcode.com/zhangyuxiang0119), [*FelixTang7*](https://gitcode.com/FelixTang7) (2/2) | ✅ [*zhangyuxiang0119*](https://gitcode.com/zhangyuxiang0119) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n xiu_ling_wang, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-04-07T11:20:11+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-07T17:26:57+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167497753,"discussion_id":"c75926b43c7c975d64920ba77f543bf88a2bcbfe","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-04-07T11:20:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-07T11:20:17+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167497779,"discussion_id":"e9f28750f3e09322190df5f51b1c1669ade36e44","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR修复了`ReduceAll`和`ReduceAny`两个算子在处理浮点数输入（BF16, FLOAT, FLOAT16）时，输出张量数据类型错误的问题。原实现无论输入类型如何，均固定输出布尔（BOOL）类型，这违反了算子的语义，并可能导致后续计算链中出现类型不匹配或精度损失。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了`reduce_all.cpp`和`reduce_any.cpp`中的输出张量分配逻辑。核心改动是将固定输出`DT_BOOL`改为根据输入数据类型动态决定：若输入为`DT_BF16`或`DT_FLOAT`，则输出`DT_FLOAT`；若输入为`DT_FLOAT16`，则输出`DT_FLOAT16`；其他情况（如`DT_BOOL`）则保持输出`DT_BOOL`。此修改确保了浮点输入经过规约操作后，输出类型得以正确保留。","created_at":"2026-04-07T11:20:27+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-07T11:20:27+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167519250,"discussion_id":"0ba59ff6eed01867cc8daf9b43b649af6dd4510f","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-04-07T14:49:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-07T14:49:53+08:00","user":{"id":"68c1466222d8d17b10e260a3","login":"xiu_ling_wang","object_id":"68c1466222d8d17b10e260a3","name":"xiu_ling_wang","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xiu_ling_wang"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167519458,"discussion_id":"b894135dcd017435621cc44c66273a2fc5f6c84b","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=4a243b02d4dd4e5dad9d292c8ac8560e&pipeli